cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. All outputs are SYNTHETIC classical toy simulations — Bell-correlation Monte Carlo, a classical metrics ledger, and digital stereo loopback; not quantum hardware, not QEC, and not consciousness."
title: "oes-quantum-binaural-lab: classical toy simulation of Bell-correlation Monte Carlo, scalar metrics ledger, and digital stereo loopback"
type: software
authors:
