license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  Offline, dependency-free Python prototype with three deliberately separate
  classical software lanes: a classical metrics ledger (1,024 scalar slots, not
  an OES detector), a Bell-correlation Monte Carlo model (stipulated cosine
  correlation with synthetic readout error; no quantum state or circuit
  evolution), and digital stereo loopback (in-memory multitone calibration; no
  audio hardware). SYNTHETIC evidence only. Membrane is a metaphor; observer
  means readout, not consciousness. No quantum advantage, QEC, or hardware
  claim.
keywords:
  - classical-simulation
  - synthetic
  - monte-carlo
  - bell-test-simulation
  - audio-calibration
  - research-software
  - reproducibility
